1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,206
Keep it out of the way.

2
00:00:01,246 --> 00:00:03,560
Hide the bar in some apps, while
you type, or until media plays.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,561
Open Visibility.

4
00:00:05,601 --> 00:00:10,360
In Gesture Volume, under Advanced
features, tap Visibility.

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:11,888
Choose when it shows.

6
00:00:11,928 --> 00:00:15,338
Two switches: only while media
plays, or only during calls.

7
00:00:15,378 --> 00:00:17,560
Leave both off and it is always there.

8
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,773
Pick what happens as you type.

9
00:00:19,813 --> 00:00:22,516
Move above the keyboard,
hide, or stay put.

10
00:00:22,556 --> 00:00:25,960
Moving, it can glide, spring
or bounce out of the way.

11
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,786
Type in another app.

12
00:00:27,826 --> 00:00:32,518
In any app, as the keyboard comes
up the bar springs above it,

13
00:00:32,558 --> 00:00:34,960
and goes back when you are done.

14
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:37,244
Pick apps to hide it in.

15
00:00:37,284 --> 00:00:43,360
Back in Visibility, tick the apps where
it should step aside. Here, Video.

16
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:45,489
There, it steps aside.

17
00:00:45,529 --> 00:00:48,066
Open Video and the bar is gone.

18
00:00:48,106 --> 00:00:50,560
Leave it, and the bar is back.

19
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:53,034
Show it on the lock screen.

20
00:00:53,074 --> 00:00:57,625
Turn on Show on the lock screen
and the bar is there too,

21
00:00:57,665 --> 00:00:59,960
for volume and quick toggles.

22
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:05,310
Thanks for watching.
